  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "In a large mixing bowl, combine mascarpone, confit tomatoes, sour cream, cheese, dill, garlic, salt, and pepper. Mix well until smooth.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a 9x13-inch baking dish and dot the top with olive oil.",
    "Bake for 25-30 minutes, or until the top is golden brown and the edges are set.",
    "Garnish with fresh thyme and serve hot."
